"title_0" = "General description of the day";
"title_1" = "What events can happen";
"title_2" = "How will the day affect your emotional state";
"title_3" = "How will the day affect your finances";
"title_4" = "What can you expect at work today";
"title_5" = "Most important event of the day";

"foolCard_financial" = "Today you are waiting for new and exciting things. Today's circumstances can make you joke or discover something new. Get ready to improvise and take the initiative today. You will be allowed to try on the role of a carefree child, for whom a serious life temporarily turns into an exciting game. Do not miss this opportunity, because probably today you will be able to find something really worthwhile for yourself that will make your soul tremble and allow you to gain personal freedom.";
"magicianCard_financial" = "Your active position can make today very successful. Today everything is in your hands and your power! You have everything you need to make the right decision, start a new project, speak publicly, or get the right people on your side. Show all your charisma and charm today, use a non-standard approach. Be a leader and everything will turn out great for you.";
"highpriestessCard_financial" = "Today you need to listen to your inner voice and act according to the situations that you will find yourself in. On this day, you should rely on your intuition, because logic will probably not be able to give you answers to your questions. Do not look for explanations and excuses for those questions that you do not want to accept. You need to appreciate the time, and every second of this day.";
"empressCard_financial" = "The Empress card will bring you an exciting day today that will help you grow and develop. You may want to go to nature to give energy and nourishment to your body and soul, do not give up on this idea - it will bring you an abundant state. You may have a lot of interesting ideas and creative ideas. Try to think about how you can implement them, because they will be really worthwhile and successful for you.";
"emperorCard_financial" = "Today you will succeed in everything that you undertake, there will be enough strength, energy and determination for everything. If you have a difficult task or a problem that has been put off for a long time, this is what you need to take on. It is necessary to act decisively, but carefully and thoroughly. Or today you will meet a powerful person, occupying a high position and gain patronage in his person.";
"hierophantCard_financial" = "Today you can get sensible, reasonable advice, a hint on how to get out of the situation, so be more sensitive to people than life experience is much wider and more diverse than yours. He can actually help you in the direction of resolving your concerns. Or you yourself can become a teacher for someone, the main thing is not to assert yourself at the expense of another.";
"lovesCard_financial" = "Today you need to make a final decision, regardless of whether it is related to professional activities or to some personal matters. If you doubted something for a long time or simply did not rush things, now fate gives you a chance to put an end to it and end a long intrapersonal conflict that slows you down and does not give you concentration and concentration. The card reminds you of the importance of making a decision and establishing a stable mindset.";
"chariotCard_financial" = "You should only move forward, overcoming all obstacles in your path. Today you will be able to eliminate the contradictions and conflicts that for a long time could exhaust and disturb you. Only your decisive steps, strong-willed decisions and disciplined actions will contribute to your luck. Remember that Fortune is a capricious lady and loves decisive people.";
"strengthCard_financial" = "Today, the card recommends that you apply your talents to work or become more active on a personal level, you will have enough strength for absolutely everything. In difficult matters, show wise perseverance and do not enter into conflicts. After all, it is your strong-willed spirit that allows you to solve problems to which you show your wisdom.";
"hermitCard_financial" = "Today you should rely only on yourself. Make decisions slowly and carefully, on your own and without the advice and opinions of others, as well as generally accepted norms. You may feel lonely today, but do not be afraid of this state - by accepting it, it will allow you to rethink and understand a lot, to shift your focus to more important things. It is advisable to move the fuss and the usual things, but if you do not have such an opportunity, you need to do them scrupulously and responsibly, relying solely on your own capabilities.";
"wheelOfFortuneCard_financial" = "Today, positive events await you in life in general or in one of its aspects. Whatever happens in your destiny, or today - everything must be accepted with gratitude and appreciated for yourself as an acquisition of new opportunities. You have the opportunity to achieve a lot today: take the first step, take the initiative - in any case, somewhere Fortune will smile at you. Events can somehow happen that will have roots in your past life.";
"justiceCard_financial" = "Thanks to this card, today can be decisive for you. You need to take the time to understand your affairs as carefully as possible, to make responsible, objective and thoughtful decisions. Try to objectively evaluate the people around you, as well as your own thoughts and actions, and make decisions based on the positions of your sound and sober mind. Nothing will be given for free, but you will not be hindered in anything today if you are ready to answer for everything you receive.";
"hangedCard_financial" = "Today you need to be patient and just get through the day. Your attempts to somehow influence the events around you and accelerate their course will only lead to the opposite result, so the best way out for you is to spend time comprehending the situation and developing action plans for the future. Even if serious business awaits you on this day, try to step back a little and not make drastic and drastic decisions. Take a mostly observer position.";
"deathCard_financial" = "Today you may feel the urge to let go and change something in your life. Any of the aspects of your being can become a passed stage and become a thing of the past. This may be good news for you that it has finally happened and everything is over. But something you may not want to part with, because it meant so much to you. In any case, you will understand that the time has come for healing and renewal, but how you perceive it depends on you. You will understand that there is nothing to be done here and you need to come to terms with the circumstances, preparing to part with the past.";
"moderationCard_financial" = "You can truly call today a magical day. You may have new discoveries, events in your life, you may feel a creative flight and inspiration, or you may be overwhelmed by a wave of calmness and dimension, which can help calm a problem that has been disturbing you for a long time. Perhaps, with the help of this state, you will be able to not only improve your life, but even help other people, solving their problems with pleasure. In any case, try to use this state productively for yourself.";
"devilCard_financial" = "Today you may encounter the shadow side of your character. Accept the challenge in the right way for you, face fear in the face and try to accept it without denying it, while consolidating the final sound decision. Perhaps someone may try to lead you astray and direct you to an unseemly act, or you completely decide to change your principles. Try to limit the impulse to the right positions of your soul or postpone decisions. This may be a temptation for you.";
"towerCard_financial" = "Today can bring quite difficult circumstances related to the loss of something very important to you. It can become decisive, important, transformational and will influence the subsequent life. But remember that any loss will turn into favorable opportunities and the achievement of new goals in the future. Try to analyze and track the causal relationship, why the loss occurs, your past decisions could lead to this and this does not give you further development.";
"starCard_financial" = "Today you will be able to catch a glimmer of hope in what you could already give up and be disappointed. A star is the awakening of your faith or the fulfillment of a dream, so try to remember what you really wanted, for example, in childhood, maybe today fate will smile at you and give you a piece of happiness. You need to appreciate the opportunities presented to you, to believe in yourself. Higher powers favor you, even if your goal seems unrealistic, the plan is crazy - do not stop, you have set yourself a goal and nothing will stop you.";
"moonCard_financial" = "Today may seem unfavorable to you and may carry a warning of danger for you, or hint that someone is deceiving you and leading you by the nose. You may have a bad dream or feel quite nervous and depressive. Try to intuitively feel what they want to warn you about. But you should not attach special importance to your dreams, and scare yourself with ghosts and mysticism.";
"sunCard_financial" = "Today you will remember some bright and happy event. It can be either a holiday in honor of the completion of something difficult, or you will defeat something or someone, or a stream of inspiration will open inside you, a truth long hidden from you will open, or just a day will pass without problems and give a feeling of happiness and cheerfulness. You should take on some new activity or implementation of a new idea, they will become successful for you. Do not forget that there are people around you who will also want to take part in this. Do not deny them the opportunity to share happiness with you.";
"doomsdayCard_financial" = "Today you can cope with any troubles and get out of impasses. And in many ways, your Guardian Angel will probably contribute to this. Moreover, some problems can be solved without your participation at all. You need to be careful and seize the opportunity in time. If you manage, then fate guarantees you success and nice bonuses. But you need to rely solely on your own strengths and take them as a basis. Miracles from above are created through the hands of people.";
"worldCard_financial" = "Today could be a very lucky day for you. Either you can go somewhere on the road today, maybe even on a trip, which will bring you incredible peace and inspiration. You will feel strength and harmony with the world around you and will be able to fully enjoy this day, its calm and favorable outlines. It will seem to you that everything is going as it should. If you are in need of a place where you can find shelter, then the card of the day guides you to take that step and change your place of residence. Or today you can clearly feel the completion of something very important for yourself.";

//Figure

"pageOfPentacles_financial" = "The card today is an auspicious day for you. It will allow you to realize your most intimate dreams. Agree on promising contracts, provide help and support to those around you, both in a moral and material sense. Also, the card can warn of the appearance in your life of a man who is quite self-contained and prudent. It can bring you any chance for new beginnings.";
"pageOfSwords_financial" = "Today you can hear criticism against you, and your proposals, most likely, can be rejected. You just need to prepare yourself for this initially, so that later you don’t get upset and don’t get up in a counterattack. By the way, criticism can be very useful for you, as it carries something of value. If you listen to the spoken words, then much will become clear in your life. There will definitely come a moment in your life when you can reveal your potential, because you have everything for this: sociability, ingenuity, quick wit, contact. Also today you can get some important information for yourself, which can unsettle you a little.";
"pageOfWands_financial" = "The Page of Wands portends a bright and unusual event. You need to be careful and not miss the sign of an upcoming pleasant surprise. This can be a promotion, and a pleasant meeting, and a dizzying romance that begins. But this does not mean at all that the event will be fateful. Perhaps this will turn out to be just a very interesting and enjoyable episode for you, which will turn into a plot for stories to your grandchildren.";
"pageOfCups_financial" = "Fate is on your side today. New opportunities and emotional nourishment will open up before you. Today is the day when you can accept the gifts of fate, while giving nothing in return. This can even manifest itself in ordinary trifles (compliments, declarations of love, an honorable compromise in difficult circumstances). Your undertakings will bear fruit, and the things you have done before will end in success. By the way, you can think about career growth, there are prospects for you.";
"knightOfPentacles_financial" = "Today you have a great chance - to make an important and responsible decision. Even a problem that seemed difficult and impossible to you will be resolved today in the best possible way. But, and if there are no problems and you don’t need to solve problems, then it’s time to relax, give yourself time for something that you later remember with pleasure. In any case, the day may seem long and slow to you.";
"knightOfSwords_financial" = "The Knight of Swords can warn you of conflict, which is why today you need to think clearly and soberly react to what is happening, and even to some extent in cold blood. Discuss, preferably without emotion. Thanks to this, even in a difficult situation, you can hope to win. But if the dispute remains without winners, this will also benefit you, not harm you.";
"knightOfWands_financial" = "The Knight of Wands may bring you some kind of quarrel or omission today. Do not start to realize your affairs and plans, keep calm. Or today you can catch fire with some idea and the desire to rush to implement it. Do not have any special illusions, you will need to weigh and analyze it, otherwise it may remain a flash.";
"knightOfCups_financial" = "Today your day will be very bright and filled with events. Your mood today will be uplifted, you will feel great, your energy will be in full swing. Use today for its intended purpose, solve cases for which you have not had enough time and energy for a long time.";
"kingOfPentacles_financial" = "Today you will have a good opportunity to take stock. Don't miss out on the opportunity to start a new business. Remember the need to achieve everything with your personal work. Everything will work out with your due concentration and concentration. Also, the card can tell you about the manifestation of a man who loves you very much. He may be much older than you in age, and may be your father.";
"kingOfSwords_financial" = "Fate may give you an exam today and you need to mentally prepare for this. You will need to show your knowledge, ingenuity and the ability to use your own experience. You must prepare well for this test, and for this you must have convincing projects, facts, arguments, it would not be superfluous for you to use your charm and wit.";
"kingOfWands_financial" = "The King of Wands brings you a good omen today. Your business will be successful. It is possible that a person will help you in one of the areas of your life. You can prepare for a windfall profit, a job offer, or just being the center of attention today. The card can also talk about a meeting with a wealthy fan or signs of attention from management.";
"kingOfCups_financial" = "The card recommends that you hold back your feelings a little today. Make decisions, first of all, coordinating them with your mind, and not with your heart. However, do not skimp on emotions with your loved one or with someone who craves your care and attention. Share what worries you, what hurts your soul. In response, you will receive only pleasant words of support, wise and effective advice. On this day, you may meet a handsome man who will play an important role in your near future.";
"queenOfPentacles_financial" = "You shouldn't let other people manipulate you. Now it's up to you, do your job consistently and keep long-term projects in mind. Today it is possible for you to meet a woman who has strong maternal feelings and kindness. It is this woman who can play an important role in your destiny. You should listen to what she has to say.";
"queenOfSwords_financial" = "Today, fate will tell you to take the right step. If quite recently you were still dependent on someone, now the day has come when everything will change significantly for you for the better. Now you don't have to be shy about anything, behave freely and naturally under any circumstances.";
"queenOfWands_financial" = "Today is the day for your decisive action, you will feel confident and strong energy. Any, even the most difficult work will be on your shoulder. You are ready to take decisive steps, you show courageous qualities and an optimistic attitude to business. Today, people around you will notice this, they will follow you, because in your life you so lack human support, optimism and wise advice.";
"queenOfCups_financial" = "Today will bring you a special sensitivity and sensuality in the emotional mood of the people around you. There is a possibility that you may suffer because of someone else's behavior. Be careful, fate sends signs everywhere. Stay true to yourself, your principles, your feelings. However, do not take what you passionately desire to possess at face value, this does not happen in reality.";

//Numeral

"aceOfPentacles_financial" = "Today, luck will follow you around. Be extremely careful, do not miss your chances, they lie in wait for you in different places and at the most unexpected time. Invest in those plans that are long-term and realistic, especially when it comes to career and earnings. If all plans are only short-term, then today will be a great start for far-reaching tasks.";
"aceOfSwords_financial" = "Today you will have the opportunity to solve a problem over which you had to rack your brains for a long time, the solution will be right in front of your nose. Be especially careful today so as not to miss this opportunity, every day such chances do not lie on the road.";
"aceOfWands_financial" = "Today you have enough energy to take on a new project. It is possible to move unresolved issues and problems “from the dead point”. Whatever idea you have visited, you can safely take on its implementation. You will succeed. Passion for creative discoveries will not leave your colleagues indifferent. They will support you in your projects. It is possible that unexpected information will appear that will open up new opportunities. Even non-standard solutions and crazy ideas can bring good cash income. It is also possible to receive news that may affect one of the areas of life.";
"aceOfCups_financial" = "A surprise for you - this is a card foreshadowing the fulfillment of a cherished desire. Everything that you think during this day will surely come true, take this chance. The card also indicates changes in your amorous affairs. Intuition tells you that something promising will happen, it is connected with a person from the environment. Today you will experience happiness like never before.";
"twoOfPentacles_financial" = "You don't have to take your work life too seriously today. A little bit of playfulness, flexibility and frivolity will be enough. Don't pass up the opportunity to try something new to test your skills. And even if something does not work out for you right away, you can always try again. On this day, you will adapt well to the tasks you receive. You may also have some business changes associated with insignificant profits. The card brings relief from despondency, and you need to properly manage this day.";
"twoOfSwords_financial" = "Today you will be overcome by doubts and worries. It may seem to you that your intuition is silent. If on this day you will need to make a very important decision, it is better not to do it. Tomorrow will come - then we'll see. It's just not the right day for it. Don't worry, use this day for rest, meditation and reflection.";
"twoOfWands_financial" = "Throw away all doubts and worries, the right decision today is to take a neutral side. If someone asks you more than you can do, say so. It is enough for you to clearly explain to the interlocutor your attitude to the matter, without imposing much responsibility on yourself. We can say that you will do it better tomorrow, not today. Thus, you can avoid unnecessary problems and stress.";
"twoOfCups_financial" = "Today you will remember the affairs of the heart, where there will be deep sympathy, love, spiritual contact or reconciliation. If you have a loved one who is already a spouse, then there will be a period when you can relive those first relationships and love that have not faded so far, but even strengthened.";
"threeOfPentacles_financial" = "The Three of Pentacles recommends today to abandon the remnants of the past that hinder your development and move to a qualitatively new level. The form of this refusal may be different for you - you can finally find out the relationship with your partner, change jobs or finish a job that has been started for a long time. In any case, this should be the end of some routine stage of a past life, which will allow you to start a new business. Also, do not be afraid to enlist support and help, this will give you a faster and easier movement towards your plans.";
"threeOfSwords_financial" = "Today is not a very happy day. At work, bad news may await. Alternatively, it will be necessary to make the right decision, which will require serious emotional effort. Do not be discouraged, try to withstand the blows of fate that await you on this day. You shouldn't bend your back in front of trouble. You need to steadfastly endure negative events so that there is hope for the beginning of a bright streak in life.";
"threeOfWands_financial" = "You have clear life guidelines. You are on the right path to your spiritual development. Today, perhaps, one of the colleagues will offer a part-time job. Perhaps - joint participation in the case, and therefore you need to agree. Joint activities will allow you to realize your creative potential. If you try, you can make good money. Using this chance, you can think about changing your profession. In a new type of activity, you will be able to fully realize your potential. At the same time, profits will increase.";
"threeOfCups_financial" = "Today will surely bring you a joyful event or good news. Mark it, share your good mood with your close circle. Invite family and friends to your place for a cozy delicious dinner, drink a wonderful bottle of wine that was once left in reserve. Do not regret, this moment has already come, and such an excellent occasion does not happen every day. Thank fate for bringing you the sweetest fruits. Reconcile with old acquaintances with whom there were squabbles and failures in relationships. This day, like no other, will be especially favorable for this.";
"fourOfPentacles_financial" = "You should consider whether the direction of your efforts is chosen correctly. Perhaps even this card indicates to you that you are spending all your energy on actions that only harm the implementation of your plans and stop you.";
"fourOfSwords_financial" = "Today is the day for you to make a decision. No matter how much I would not like to postpone this moment, there is nowhere to pull further. The decision may concern one of the areas of your life. Once you take this important step, you will immediately feel better.";
"fourOfWands_financial" = "Today is the day when you can do whatever your soul asks. You can safely meet new people, because there is a chance that among them there may be those who will become true friends. You can make a gift to your beloved (or beloved) or organize a real holiday. If there is a person with whom you are in a quarrel, this is the best day for reconciliation. Sad thoughts must be driven away from yourself on this day.";
"fourOfCups_financial" = "Today, any little thing can spoil your mood. Health problems are also not ruled out. If there is a reason that causes you such feelings as sadness and longing, do not get carried away by these emotions, continue to be open to the world, which will definitely help you rehabilitate. In addition, there are many opportunities around that you should not miss out on your own stupidity.";
"fiveOfPentacles_financial" = "You should not build far-reaching plans for such a day - all the same, things will not go the way they should and the way you would like. Perhaps you should think about changing your priorities in life. An unfavorable streak in life can be expected ahead. But life, as you know, is like a zebra, so you should accept the upcoming trials with dignity, endure them patiently, and things will get better quickly.";
"fiveOfSwords_financial" = "Serious troubles may await you today. You need to be careful not to become a victim of scammers and thieves. At work and in your personal life, you need to prepare for possible conflicts. On this day, it is better not to do anything serious.";
"fiveOfWands_financial" = "Today you have a test, so you need to be as prepared as possible for it. Do not worry about this, because this is a kind of exam, as a result of which, you will be able to confirm to yourself your ability to solve problems, which will positively affect your self-esteem. This can affect different areas, for example, psychological confrontation with a loved one or competition at work, and here and there you can’t give up, you need to show that you are still in great shape.";
"fiveOfCups_financial" = "Today, inevitable disappointments and disappointments can happen. Even if it seemed to you that success is on your side, and everything works out in business, then this day will show you the other side of the issue. If it has something to do with minor flaws, then take it with humor. But if you have to be sad about a serious matter, then you need to accept everything with dignity, without hiding anything from other people. Therefore, try to assess the situation not fatally, but as soberly and sensibly as possible, do not give in to despondency, but think about how to improve the situation.";
"sixOfPentacles_financial" = "Today is your day to help others. Do not skimp on a good deed, be generous and later it will return to you in a larger size, when difficulties arise in your life as well. If there is no way to lend, help physically, at least listen to the person with all your attention, give valuable and wise advice.";
"sixOfSwords_financial" = "An interesting day awaits you today, which does not bode well. The card says that you need to prepare for change, and the sooner this happens, the easier it will be for you later. The main thing is to control your own destiny, and not depend on any circumstances.";
"sixOfWands_financial" = "Today will be very successful for you, it will bring many pleasant surprises in the form of completed problems that you have been working on for a long period of time. The things you started recently will go uphill. It is worth remembering that only those cases that brought you headaches and big expenses will have a successful resolution, that is, achieving the goal will be fully justified and deserved for you. At the household level, a card may simply portend you with a monetary reward or bonus. It is worth sharing the taste of victory with loved ones, arrange a holiday! This will bring pleasant emotions to you and those around you.";
"sixOfCups_financial" = "Today will give you memories. You will be able to understand yourself: what you wanted, what you dreamed about in the past, what came true and did not come true from this until today. Thanks to such an analysis, many forgotten dreams can come true. The past can really give clues to the present and future of you. There may be a meeting with someone who has not been seen for a long time, or maybe there will be an important thing that was once lost. You have a chance to become happy, joyful, in love again. Is it possible to deny yourself the hope - to be happy, because for this we live.";
"sevenOfPentacles_financial" = "Today is clearly not a rush day, you should be more patient and slow. Take into account every detail, weigh every decision in your head before you approve it. Any oversight today will provoke the emergence of difficult situations for you, the solution of which will require large material and energy costs in the future. It makes no sense to violate plans that are long and painfully implemented. If you are not in the mood for patience, just take a breather, relax, spend time with benefit, pay attention to those closest to you, surprise your loved one with a pleasant surprise. Kindness will definitely be returned to you.";
"sevenOfSwords_financial" = "When leaving the house, it is advisable for you to hide important things securely, because there is a very high probability of theft. Also on this day, you may encounter betrayal and fraud. Solving some of your questions, you may have to be cunning and dodge, but the result for you will be positive. In any case, be on the lookout for the purity of your intentions and those of others.";
"sevenOfWands_financial" = "The card says that today you will need to persevere in the affairs you have previously started, and success will not be long in coming. For what you need to fight and defend your position. Therefore, today do not spare your nerves, protecting yourself, you will avoid big problems.";
"sevenOfCups_financial" = "The card says that you have fallen into the network of your own unfulfilled desires and illusions. You are removed from reality and this day can be wasted for you, unless, of course, you try to return to the real world. There is a high probability of becoming a victim of a scammer on this day if you chase ghostly earnings. Also on this day, you can fall in love with the invented hero of your novel.";
"eightOfPentacles_financial" = "On this day, you should not indulge in laziness, but hard work will bring you very tempting results. Today is a good day to discover your talent - you will definitely deserve recognition. Laziness can overcome you, unwillingness to work will push you to come up with some reason to shirk. You can even use false for this. So try not to succumb to the provocations of your body and the games of your mind, or simply provide yourself with a blanket with a cup of coffee in advance, if you really organize it.";
"eightOfSwords_financial" = "Today is a day of complete isolation for you. This can happen to you either of your own free will, for example, you just want to take a day off from all business, or under the influence of unforeseen circumstances. The Eight of Swords also warns you that on this day you will have to experience fear. Also, the card may hint to you that today you will have to make a choice you have been putting off for a long time.";
"eightOfWands_financial" = "Your day will be very busy today. You will have practically no time to relax, as events will develop at an insane pace. On this day, pleasant surprises, news, interesting meetings will fall on you. The main thing is to do everything and not fall off your feet from activity. You will have to spin like a squirrel in a wheel.";
"eightOfCups_financial" = "On this day, you will face the fact that the old schemes no longer work. It's time for you to give them up, especially today all the surrounding circumstances will push you to this. Your mood on this day will be rather sad, and the state itself will be burdensome. It will be with some touch of soreness due to the fact that rose-colored glasses will fall from your eyes.";
"nineOfPentacles_financial" = "Today is a very auspicious day for you, which will bring you a lot of pleasure from what is happening. On this day, all plans will be easily implemented by you, so use it correctly and for its intended purpose.";
"nineOfSwords_financial" = "Today is a problematic day for you: everything that happens will make you worry quite a lot, and probably all the experience will come down to the fact that you just screwed yourself up. Fears can arise out of nowhere and are easily subdued. You need to call on a loved one to help you deal with the oppressive demons of the soul. Try not to make categorical decisions today.";
"nineOfWands_financial" = "Today for you is a day of decisive action, reasonable stubbornness, perseverance and courage in making decisions. Now you are full of strength and energy to take some important step. Don't miss this amazing opportunity!";
"nineOfCups_financial" = "Today you have an idle day on which you can indulge in laziness and relax, not for a minute thinking about any problems. Everything in your life goes on as usual, and your participation in this is not required. Today you can have parties or pleasant gatherings with friends, meeting with your loved one, and the evening promises to be very passionate. Your day will be so successful that you will fall asleep with a smile.";
"tenOfPentacles_financial" = "This card promises you a great day today, which they say: everything is arguing in the hands. Any of your affairs on this day will bring success, especially when it comes to finances. A pleasant surprise for you may be a gift or help from close relatives. It is advisable for you to devote this day to your family as much as possible, or at least call your parents.";
"tenOfSwords_financial" = "On this day, you will experience a lot of unpleasant things. As a result, you may feel that life has no further meaning, because it has reached a complete dead end. Forces seem to leave you forever and there may be a feeling of spiritual devastation. However, don't get depressed. One day of trouble is not your whole life. Tomorrow will be a new day and everything will change.";
"tenOfWands_financial" = "Today promises you an unbearable lot of work, which can even lead you to extreme fatigue. You will not have the opportunity to shirk from it, and you will have to carry the burden that has been dumped on yourself without groans and groans. But do not despair - stock up on patience and endurance and do not forget to take a time out at least sometimes.";
"tenOfCups_financial" = "On this day, you will rise in everything. Your business will be successfully moving forward, you will feel support from all sides. Harmony and mutual understanding will reign in the family. This is a wonderful day to improve relationships, make peace after a quarrel with a loved one or friends, put an end to a protracted dispute.";
